WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:07.180
What does the perfect skeleton in a great
pirate story look like? That´s only one of

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.139
the many questions you have to ask yourself
when you are trying to create a world like

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:17.540
One Piece. Does it have an eyepatch? Maybe
some rotten skin left on its face? Of course

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:25.700
not. A REAL skeleton pirate needs just ONE
thing: And that is an afro. There we go.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.830
Brook is without a doubt one of the most creative
and bizarre character´s that Eiichiro Oda

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:36.720
has created over all these years. And as we
all know, that definitely says something.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:41.600
Even in a world, where talking reindeers,
giant mermaids and other crazy figures are

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:47.600
a part of everyday life; a reanimated, music-loving
and joke-cracking skeleton with an afro is

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:57.040
something that catches the eye…even if it
doesn´t have any. But beyond his unique appearance,

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:02.020
Brook as a character actually has a lot more
to him than meets the eye, to stay with the

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:07.759
reference. Not only does he play one of my
favorite songs in anime ever, but he also

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:13.429
represents a theme that all of the straw hats
share. But none as blatantly as Brook: Loyalty.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:21.860
There is actually a good reason that Brook
is not only one of the quirkiest, but also

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:27.170
the oldest straw hat on Luffy´s ship. With
a proud 90 years on his back, he had already

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:32.530
experienced a lot in his life before any of
the other straw hats were even born. We actually

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:37.859
do not know too much about Brook´s early
years, except that he used to serve as a soldier

00:01:37.859 --> 00:01:42.920
in an unnamed kingdom located somewhere in
the West Blue. We do not know exactly WHAT

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:48.379
HAPPENED during that time. However, a couple
of years later Brook finally decided to set

00:01:48.379 --> 00:01:53.970
out to sea. He joined the music loving Rumbar
Pirates under the lead of captain Yorki and

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:59.370
together they set out towards the grand line.
On their way there they encountered the small

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:04.970
island whale Laboon that had been separated
from his herd. Brook and the others, who quickly

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:09.810
developed a close relationship with him, decided
to take the young whale with them on their

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:14.360
journey. Upon traversing reverse mountain
however, they decided to leave Laboon with

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.110
Crocus at the lighthouse, promising him that
they would come back for him one day and take

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:25.190
him with them on their journey. However, this
wasn´t meant to happen, as parts of the crew

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:30.450
one day caught an incurable disease, during
one of their adventures. To protect the rest

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:35.620
of the crew, those who were infected, including
Brook´s captain Yorki, decided to leave the

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:40.340
ship and try to make their way through the
calm belt. An utterly hopeless endeavor, to

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:46.620
say the least. After losing half of his friends,
Brook was appointed as the new captain. And

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.760
he led his men successfully for some time,
before they were attacked by enemies upon

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.210
entering the Florian triangle. While they
somehow just managed to get away from the

00:02:55.210 --> 00:03:00.240
fight, to their horror they had to find out
that their enemy´s weapons had been poisoned.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.620
Brook, knowing that he would be revived by
the power of his devil fruit, suggested in

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.640
tears to play one final song together, that
he would record and bring to Laboon, in order

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:15.960
to keep their promise. Slowly one by one,
he had to watch his friends die, before finally

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:21.830
he also succumbed to the poison. After his
soul actually returned back to earth, for

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:27.200
a long time, he wasn´t able to find his body
in the thick mists of the Florian triangle.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:32.040
And when he finally managed to find his way
back to the ship, his body had already turned

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:38.399
into a skeleton. Unable to stir the ship on
his own, he was damned to spent nearly 50

00:03:38.399 --> 00:03:44.530
years in bitter loneliness. Finally, he stranded
on thriller bark. However instead of finding

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:49.920
new friends, he had his shadow stolen by Gekko
Moria, who used it to reanimate the legendary

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:56.460
samurai Ryuma. Brook tried to take his shadow
back from the swordsman but was utterly defeated.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:02.099
He then fled back to his ship and spent the
next 5 years training for their rematch. This

00:04:02.099 --> 00:04:07.850
is, when Brook finally meets Luffy and the
other straw hats. Despite being overwhelmed

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:12.739
with joy by finally meeting other people,
he at first declines Luffy´s invitation to

00:04:12.739 --> 00:04:18.059
join the crew, not wanting to be a nuisance.
However, after the events on thriller bark,

00:04:18.059 --> 00:04:22.749
fighting side by side with the straw hats,
he finally accepts and officially becomes

00:04:22.749 --> 00:04:27.299
the 9th member of the crew.
Now, as we can tell from this quite extensive

00:04:27.299 --> 00:04:32.480
backstory, Brook has not only suffered through
many hardships and tragedies in his life but

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:37.610
has also already had a great deal of character
development even before the start of the story

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:42.359
itself. Keep that in mind, because this is
something that will become important again

00:04:42.359 --> 00:04:47.639
later on. Before we can look at his character
arc though, we first have to understand what

00:04:47.639 --> 00:04:54.649
kind of person Brook actually is.
In the context of the story we know Brook

00:04:54.649 --> 00:05:00.940
as a very polite and at times extremely eccentric
personality. In the manga, this is combined

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:06.239
with a strong sense of humor and a bit of
perverted mentality. The anime, however, takes

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:12.969
this a step further. And in many cases one
step too far. Random jokes are often inserted

00:05:12.969 --> 00:05:20.170
at unfitting moments and his perverted nature
is often also taken way overboard. As a result,

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:25.679
anime-brook sometimes feels a bit like a forced
running gag. Which is sad, because in the

00:05:25.679 --> 00:05:31.170
manga Brook´s personality appears rather
charming. Here the focus lies more on his

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:37.749
compassionate and kind side. In addition to
that Brook is also a very skilled fighter.

00:05:37.749 --> 00:05:42.839
Being a more than capable swordsman and owning
a very unique and powerful devil fruit, Brook

00:05:42.839 --> 00:05:47.549
is always there to fight side by side with
his friends, which rounds him of as a great

00:05:47.549 --> 00:05:52.589
character in an action-based story.
Brook´s psychological need in the story is

00:05:52.589 --> 00:05:58.499
rather straightforward. Up until joining Luffy
and the crew, he heavily suffers under the

00:05:58.499 --> 00:06:03.859
loneliness he had to endure for almost half
a century. In other words, when we first get

00:06:03.859 --> 00:06:10.160
to meet him, Brook has to learn how to overcome
his loneliness. This also translates directly

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.910
to his moral need. His long time alone, being
disconnected form the world has resulted in

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:21.279
Brook often overexpressing his emotions. While
it is not something that emotionally hurts

00:06:21.279 --> 00:06:26.690
those around him, it still often leads to
a lot of annoyance and confusion towards him.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:31.290
We can see this for example the first time
Brook encounters the straw hats. While they

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:35.709
are understandably terrified about a speaking
skeleton, Brook forgets, they are talking

00:06:35.709 --> 00:06:41.410
about himself and starts freaking out too.
At the same time, it should be noted however,

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:46.800
that his emotional side is also one of Brook´s
greatest qualities. This best reflects in

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:52.499
his dream, which is to finally reunite with
his old friend Laboon at reverse mountain.

00:06:52.499 --> 00:06:57.600
Underlying this beautiful, but also simple
dream is the famous theme of getting a second

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:02.549
shot at life and making the best out of it.
In a world that is centered around the idea

00:07:02.549 --> 00:07:08.209
of dreams, Brook has gotten the ultimate opportunity
to get a second chance at living his live

00:07:08.209 --> 00:07:12.889
the way he wants.
As a result, Brook holds a clear set of values

00:07:12.889 --> 00:07:18.649
and ideals, that are closely connected to
his long and extraordinary life. Having spent

00:07:18.649 --> 00:07:24.179
many years quite literally in darkness and
solitude, relationships between people are

00:07:24.179 --> 00:07:29.639
one of the most important things for the skeleton.
He treasures being and sharing experiences

00:07:29.639 --> 00:07:35.899
with other people above all else. No wonder
then, that in close relation to this, kindness

00:07:35.899 --> 00:07:41.179
and friendship are also an important part
of that list. Of course, we can BEST see all

00:07:41.179 --> 00:07:46.399
of this in his relationship with Laboon. But
Brook also lives by these principles in the

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:51.519
adventures he shares with his crew. He doesn´t
hesitate one second to protect Franky and

00:07:51.519 --> 00:07:55.980
Robin on Thriller Bark, even though he barely
knows them at this point. And a little later

00:07:55.980 --> 00:08:02.440
he stands in front of Kuma on Sabaody, protecting
Sanji and Usopp. As the musician of the straw-hat

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:07.619
crew, Brook of course also strongly values
the power of music which is a big part of

00:08:07.619 --> 00:08:13.100
his character in many ways. He even uses it
as part of his fighting style, as we can for

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:18.369
example see in his standoff with Big Mom.
Most importantly however, Brook has a strong

00:08:18.369 --> 00:08:23.970
sense of loyalty. While everyone in the crew
without a doubt shares that quality, I think

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:29.740
Brook personifies it best. Not only is he
extremely loyal towards Luffy, following all

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:35.480
his orders without question, but he generally
became loyal towards everyone in the crew

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:41.310
at an incredible speed. Despite joining the
crew only very late on in the story, he faithfully

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:45.210
stands in front of his newfound family right
from the start.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:49.410
So now that we got to understand Brook as
a character a little better, let´s find out

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:56.901
how his character has developed over the course
of the story.

00:08:56.901 --> 00:09:01.530
Being the last straw hat to join the crew,
with the exception of Jinbei, who is an exception

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:06.730
in more than just one way, Brook´s character
arc so far has been significantly different

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:12.760
from the other straw hats. The most important
arc for him is without a doubt Thriller Bark,

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:18.290
where we get introduced to his character as
well as to his past. In a way, Brook´s flashbacks

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:23.600
in themselves ALREADY serve as a significant
amount of character development: Becoming

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:30.270
a pirate, setting out to sea, meeting Laboon,
losing his crew, returning back to life, being

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:35.900
alone and lost in the darkness for years and
year and then finally getting his shadow stolen

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:42.250
from him? I think we can all agree that all
this DOES something to a person. It´s a very

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:48.380
emotional and impressive backstory. But the
problem here is, that it´s exactly that:

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:53.830
A backstory. We were not there to witness
any of these events as they were happening

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:58.900
and even though they have largely shaped Brook
into the amazing character he is today, we

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:03.400
didn´t have the chance to witness and suffer
through all of this WITH him, as we could

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:08.170
with for example Usopp. The most important
character development for Brook that we are

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:13.280
able to be a part of, is him overcoming his
loneliness and regaining control over his

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:19.580
life by joining Luffy. Yes, with the end of
thriller bark, Brook has found a new purpose

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:24.430
in his second chance at life; but all this
development happened over a very short span

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:29.910
of time after we had JUST gotten introduced
to his character. The timing of Brook joining

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:35.670
left us very little time for emotionally integrating
him properly into the ranks of the crew. As

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:41.020
a result, it truly speaks for his personality
that he could use the little time he was given

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:46.690
before the time skip the way he did. He protects
his new friends on Sabaody and following Ace's

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:52.260
death, he already shows a surprising amount
of compassion and concern for Luffy's feelings.

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:58.040
He also immediately finds the resolve to work
hard for his new captain and get even stronger.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:03.020
However, both these arcs make it difficult
for Brook to show case his skills and find

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:08.250
his niche in the crew. Which is probably the
reason why some people have had difficulties

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:13.860
truly warming up to his character. The same
problem occurred after the time skip, where

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:18.970
similar to the other grand-line straw hats,
he had a significant lack of screen time.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:23.480
In Brook´s case, this lack proved to be a
lot more impactful though than it did for

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:29.030
Chopper, Robin and Franky, who all had important
roles to play up until this point.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:34.450
And then, out of the blue Whole Cake Island
happened. And as if Oda wanted to make up

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:39.180
for his previous lack of focus, it somehow
developed into the most significant arc for

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:44.490
our skeleton since Thriller bark. Somewhere
in between escaping Dressrosa and leaving

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:50.090
Zou to help save Sanji, Brook seems to have
gained a much stronger resolve. It’s very

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:54.560
possible that his fight with Giolla, as well
as his fight with Sheepshead, made Brook feel

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:59.360
like he wasn’t pulling his weight. Maybe
he felt like he needed to make a better effort

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:03.770
to help his captain and crewmates, now that
they were starting to face more and more powerful

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:09.110
enemies. What appears certain to me though,
is that this was a true turning point for

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:14.750
his character, which felt really really good
seeing after such a long time. It just would

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:19.910
have been really cathartic to see that change
of heart in the story in some way or form.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:25.140
Because it is moments like these which make
One Piece so amazing. So hopefully we will

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:30.670
get to see more of that in the future.
Coming back to the arc itself however, Brook

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:35.390
was finally able to play a significant part
in the crew´s actions for pretty much the

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:41.190
first time ever. He takes on many of Big Mom´s
men, giving us some amazing battle scenes

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:47.770
where he makes full use of his truly badass
powers. Later he manages to retrieve a copy

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:53.260
of Big Mom´s Road Poneglyph that is an essential
element in finding the One Piece. And then

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:59.620
he actually singlehandedly dares to face the
emperor herself. And despite being hopelessly

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:05.910
overpowered, he stood his ground without a
second thought. He then gave a flaming speech,

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:10.620
once again showing his great loyalty and respect
towards his captain, in which he even dares

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:15.910
to call Big Mom a “young lady”. While
this alone would already have been an incredible

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:20.850
feat for him, Brook then goes on to be the
one to break mother caramel´s photo at the

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:26.310
tea party. Together with Chopper he stands
his ground against Katakuri´s and Perospero´s

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:32.830
men, defending the Sunny. And later he helps
carrot taking out Daifuku´s fleet. Finally,

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:38.560
he is the one to take out Zeus from underneath
Big Mom´s feet, not only saving the ship

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:45.120
but also granting Nami a powerful new weapon.
So, finally long after joining Luffy Brook

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:49.570
seems to have found his place in the crew
and has proven himself to be a true straw

